opencorvus serve

starts a headless opencorvus server

Options:
  -h, --help                        show help                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version                     show version number                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs                  print logs to stderr                                   [boolean]
      --log-level                   log level   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --port                        port to listen on                       [number] [default: 7878]
      --hostname                    hostname to listen on            [string] [default: "127.0.0.1"]
      --mdns                        enable mDNS service discovery (defaults hostname to 0.0.0.0)
                                                                          [boolean] [default: false]
      --mdns-domain                 custom domain name for mDNS service
                                                              [string] [default: "opencorvus.local"]
      --cors                        additional domains to allow for CORS       [array] [default: []]
      --project-dir                 default project directory for all task operations (sandbox)
                                                                                            [string]
      --startup-receipt             path a framed machine startup receipt is published to   [string]
      --startup-occurrence          identity of the launch occurrence the startup receipt settles
                                                                                            [string]
      --parent-pid                  managed host process identifier                         [number]
      --parent-process-instance-id  managed host operating-system process-instance fingerprint
                                                                                            [string]
      --watchdog-interval-ms        managed parent watchdog interval in milliseconds        [number]
